#!args --test model
# editortest --test model: the self-checks of RichDoc, CodeDoc and the highlighter (model.rs):
# editing, formats, paragraphs, lists, undo merging, JSON / HTML / clipboard fragments, plain
# text, links; lines, auto-indent, block indent, comments, moving lines, find / replace,
# columns, the change journal; the tokens of Rust, JSON, INI, TOML and Markdown with their states
# across lines; 100 000 lines tokenized and searched.  The whole test runs before the UI
# starts; the exit code is the number of failures.
# Diagnostics: characters to bytes, clamping, counts, at / next, how they follow typing, Enter,
# deletes, points, block indent, comments, moved lines, undo / redo, replace_all, 100 000 lines;
# the JFS grammar token by token against JFScript's tokens() on two samples, interpolation,
# numbers, comments over lines.
# (E10) JavaScript (regular expressions, template strings over lines and their ${..}), CSS
# (selectors, blocks, nested rules, minified), HTML (tags over lines, entities, <script> as
# JavaScript and <style> as CSS up to their end tag), WAT; long minified lines of each.
